    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：大胡</span></p><span></span><p><span>上个月巴塔在白河办传统攀岩节，我去出摊儿，偶遇了胡哥。王大介绍时说，这就是翻译“快挂”中文名的人。哇，见到传说中的人物了，激动之余要了微信，于是有了这期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 谁翻译了快挂的中文名？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 如何接触攀岩的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 认识了攀登搭档曾山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 1994年野攀用什么装备？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 从北京骑车到拉萨第一人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 骑行拉萨住哪儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 聊聊《Climbing Beijing》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a> 密云天仙瀑百米瀑攀冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 打冰球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3861">64:21</a> 1990年玉珠峰攀登</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4692">78:12</a> 哪项户外运动最好玩儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4895">81:35</a> 跟摄制组去广西拍蝙蝠</span></p>]]></description>
