    <guid isPermaLink="false">68dbcc378e321a0d6f7f1fd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Sep 2025 12:42:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：大头</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年是头哥的PTL四番战，继去年三番战完赛之后，我很好奇是什么原因让他再一次踏上征程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 结缘攀岩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 体重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 什么是PTL?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 有运动基础吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a> PTL路线分三种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 今年部分精英运动员的退赛原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 完赛牛铃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 日常跑量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 五台山遇险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> PTL组队要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4100">68:20</a> PTL一番战，退赛。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4713">78:33</a> PTL二番战，退赛。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5196">86:36</a> PTL三番战，完赛！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5980">99:40</a> PTL四番战，完赛！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6310">105:10</a> 超长距离越野跑与短距离的差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6690">111:30</a> 包里有什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6982">116:22</a> 跑到极限是什么感觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7204">120:04</a> 会因为体重面对伤病问题吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7219">120:19</a> 参赛费用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7221">120:21</a> 如果我想跑PTL，该如何准备？</span></p>]]></description>
